      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'Never bet 2x. Statistically, you should either bet 1x (to see the hand) or 3x (on a winner). The middle ground is mathematically inferior.',
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Don't chase the Aces Up bet unless you are prepared for high volatility; the house edge is significantly higher than the standard game.",
